message: "引用本仓库时，请注明仓库名称、最后核实日期，并保留利益相关声明。"
type: dataset
title: "GPT 代开 / ChatGPT 代充安全吗？付钱前的 7 项核验与 9 种常见骗局 (chatgpt-plus-daichong-safety)"
abstract: >-
  A Chinese-language safety guide for people who pay a third party to activate
  ChatGPT Plus or Pro 5x on their own account (called GPT 代开 or 代充 in
  Chinese): seven checks to make before
  paying, nine scam patterns, what submitting a ChatGPT session means under
  OpenAI's Terms of Use, how to revoke access afterwards, and an order status
  glossary. Maintained by the team behind KAI (kaigpt.ai), an independent third
  party with no affiliation with OpenAI.
authors:
  - name: "KAI · 开gptAI 维护团队"
